    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "w9qw0e4",
      "content": "1. The battle in which Alexander the Great defeated King Porus was fought on the banks of which river?"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "2f6jdvj",
      "content": "   (a) Sutlej   (b) Ravi   (c) Jhelum (Hydaspes)   (d) Chenab"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "e2u667g",
      "content": "<strong>   Answer: (c) Jhelum (Hydaspes)</strong>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "eb21opb",
      "content": "2. Who founded the Khalsa Panth on Baisakhi 1699?"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "fxoz9tn",
      "content": "   (a) Guru Arjan Dev Ji   (b) Guru Tegh Bahadur Ji   (c) Guru Hargobind Ji   (d) Guru Gobind Singh Ji"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "4ysuehi",
      "content": "<strong>   Answer: (d) Guru Gobind Singh Ji</strong>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "7g18vh0",
      "content": "3. Punjab was formally annexed by the British on which date?"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "ox8zv63",
      "content": "   (a) March 29, 1848   (b) March 29, 1849   (c) August 15, 1847   (d) April 13, 1849"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "dps4yaz",
      "content": "<strong>   Answer: (b) March 29, 1849</strong>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "zfyfc42",
      "content": "4. Jallianwala Bagh massacre took place on:"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "5z8ajuh",
      "content": "   (a) April 13, 1918   (b) April 14, 1919   (c) April 13, 1919   (d) March 23, 1919"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "g6dvf2e",
      "content": "<strong>   Answer: (c) April 13, 1919</strong>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "1ncs83x",
      "content": "5. Who among the following was the first Governor-General of India to order annexation of Punjab?"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "z093nb7",
      "content": "   (a) Lord Canning   (b) Lord Dalhousie   (c) Lord Curzon   (d) Lord Bentinck"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "549wbt4",
      "content": "<strong>   Answer: (b) Lord Dalhousie</strong>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "zyffj3m",
      "content": "6. The Ghadar Party was founded in which year and city?"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "f40jxv6",
      "content": "   (a) 1905, London   (b) 1907, Berlin   (c) 1913, San Francisco   (d) 1915, Tokyo"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "cusjftp",
      "content": "<strong>   Answer: (c) 1913, San Francisco</strong>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "6y4d0de",
      "content": "7. Which Sikh Guru compiled the Adi Granth in 1604?"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "j6p76xq",
      "content": "   (a) Guru Nanak Dev Ji   (b) Guru Ram Das Ji   (c) Guru Arjan Dev Ji   (d) Guru Gobind Singh Ji"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "uylpixm",
      "content": "<strong>   Answer: (c) Guru Arjan Dev Ji</strong>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "zdxsw1m",
      "content": "8. Operation Blue Star was carried out in:"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "sldnghe",
      "content": "   (a) May 1984   (b) June 1984   (c) October 1984   (d) December 1984"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "lfaejon",
      "content": "<strong>   Answer: (b) June 1984</strong>"
    },
    {
      "id": "irkg9iz",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "12.2 Geography :Practice Questions"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "c6bj5x5",
      "content": "9. Punjab's largest river by length flowing entirely through Indian Punjab is:"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "7e4ol9l",
      "content": "   (a) Beas   (b) Ravi   (c) Sutlej   (d) Chenab"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "brsmpnc",
      "content": "<strong>   Answer: (c) Sutlej</strong>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "pj6b5dd",
      "content": "10. Harike Wetland (Hari-ke-Pattan) is formed at the confluence of which two rivers?"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "hjgwk2v",
      "content": "   (a) Sutlej and Ravi   (b) Beas and Ravi   (c) Beas and Sutlej   (d) Jhelum and Chenab"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "p1j3hlo",
      "content": "<strong>   Answer: (c) Beas and Sutlej</strong>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "h6py555",
      "content": "11. Punjab was reorganized into three separate states/UT on:"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "18rpzq5",
      "content": "   (a) November 1, 1966   (b) November 1, 1956   (c) January 26, 1950   (d) August 15, 1947"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "tguw7pm",
      "content": "<strong>   Answer: (a) November 1, 1966</strong>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "mx8mddj",
      "content": "12. The state animal of Punjab is:"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "i5a8pqb",
      "content": "   (a) Nilgai   (b) Blackbuck   (c) Snow leopard   (d) Tiger"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "id": "j6xuasl",
      "content": "<strong>   Answer: (b) Blackbuck</strong>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "8y50x8r",
      "content": "13. Bhakra-Nangal Dam is constructed on which river?"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "ytop75v",
      "content": "   (a) Beas   (b) Ravi   (c) Sutlej   (d) Chenab"
