    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "zdig8a0",
      "content": "14. Which district of Punjab is known as the 'Steel City'?"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "zpwljuy",
      "content": "   (a) Ludhiana   (b) Mandi Gobindgarh (Fatehgarh Sahib)   (c) Bathinda   (d) Jalandhar"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "dkitkf8",
      "content": "<strong>   Answer: (b) Mandi Gobindgarh (in Fatehgarh Sahib district)</strong>"
    },
    {
